      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "TT shutdown + board reset. Queue this on its own when you are done generating.\n\n- server_url points at the media server ComfyUI started (TT_SERVER_PORT=8010 on p11t07), so the loader attaches to it and never spins up a new one.\n- Works whatever model is loaded (sdxl, wan22, ltx): model_type is ignored when server_url is set.\n- If no server is running, the loader errors with 'Could not reach tt-metal server'. That means there was nothing to stop; the boards were not reset. Reset by hand with ~/.local/bin/tt-smi -r if needed.\n- reset_board=true resets ALL Tenstorrent boards on the host. Make sure nothing else (e.g. a tt-model container) is using them."
      ]
    }
  ],
